Output docs/gifs/18-cli-overview.gif
Output docs/gifs/mp4/18-cli-overview.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1400
Set Height 860
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Hide
Type `export PS1='$ '; alias sap-ai-dev='node src/launcher.mjs'; alias sap-ai-webgui='node src/webgui-server.mjs'; clear` Enter
Show
Type "sap-ai-dev --help | head -32" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 8s
